</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>out</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to output struct to receive new 3-phase gate states. </para>
</parameterdescription>
